 of food to be cooked, spices, sauces, beverages, etc. It should not be used to hold excessive weight. The Denali grill shelves can hold up to 45lbs and the rest of the grill shelves can hold up to 20lbs.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_mYRfhC":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How should I preheating?","text":"<p>Ensuring proper preheating of the grill is crucial for achieving the desired high temperature. Begin by lighting the grill following the instructions in your owner's manual. Then, turn up the burners, cover the grill with the lid, and wait approximately 15 minutes.<\/p><p>After this time, the grill should reach a temperature between 500 and 550 degrees Fahrenheit. Properly preheating your grill is also essential for preventing food from sticking to the cooking grates.<\/p>","read_number":0}}},"block_order":["category_YbEL79","question_8rmJnJ","question_VVrGd6","question_HdTpHB","question_PbBJKM","question_JDEbNU","question_mYRfhC"],"settings":{"heading":"FAQs on 4-Burner Gas Grills","heading_align":"text-center","color_scheme":"none","full_width":true}},"1709290372794ca6d9":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"yotpo_product_reviews_ugc_reviews_hWrkzb":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/reviews\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}}},"block_order":["yotpo_product_reviews_ugc_reviews_hWrkzb"],"settings":{"link_id":"","full_width":false}}},"order":["main","rich_text_GPJtyQ","image_banner_fzj3Wf","icons_with_text_cc9MeK","details","rich_text_Xf3eFm","multi_column_FhRDWy","rich_text_KWf7N3","multi_column_jkea4R","parts_dot_HjncrA","media_with_text_33nNqM","product_comparison_grid_P3476i","featured_video_WjTAdC","recommendations","video_Uzjt9f","product_comparison_grid_zngHnB","icons_with_text_wtQHNp","faq_tcPUPr","1709290372794ca6d9"]}